@* <summary>Seção pública do AdMetricsPro, preservando a composição e as interações da referência.</summary> *@
<section class="relative z-10 w-full py-space-3xl px-gutter-mobile lg:px-gutter" id="planos">
    <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="text-center max-w-[760px] mb-space-3xl">
            <h2 class="font-headline-section text-headline-section text-on-surface font-bold tracking-tight mb-space-sm">
                Escolha a estrutura para o seu próximo estágio.
            </h2>
            <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">
                Comece com 14 dias gratuitos, sem cartão. Compare os recursos abaixo e veja os valores dos planos na etapa de escolha durante o cadastro.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 3 Cards de Preços -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-space-lg w-full items-stretch mb-space-2xl">
            <!-- Plano Essencial -->
            <div class="p-space-xl rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-low shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-surface-container transition-all pricing-card">
                <div>
                    <span class="font-mono-code text-mono-code font-bold text-outline uppercase mb-1 block">ENTRADA</span>
                    <h3 class="font-headline-card text-headline-card text-on-surface font-bold mb-space-sm">
                Starter
            </h3>
                    <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-space-md">
                Para gestores e operações enxutas que querem centralizar suas primeiras contas.
            </p>
                    <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1 mb-space-lg">
                        <span class="font-label-metric text-label-metric font-bold text-on-surface">14 dias grátis</span>
                        <span class="font-body-sm text-outline">sem cartão</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-sm text-body-sm">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-surface">
                            <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary text-[18px]">check</span>2 assentos de usuário
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-surface">
                            <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary text-[18px]">check</span>Até 3 workspaces
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-surface">
                            <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary text-[18px]">check</span>Até R$ 50 mil em mídia
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-surface">
                            <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary text-[18px]">check</span>Meta Ads e Google Ads
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-surface">
                            <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary text-[18px]">check</span>Contas e campanhas centralizadas
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-surface">
                            <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary text-[18px]">check</span>Relatórios padrão
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <a class="mt-space-xl w-full py-space-md rounded-xl font-body-md font-semibold text-center text-on-surface bg-surface-container hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-all" href="/onboarding">Começar teste grátis</a>
            </div>

            <!-- Plano Profissional (Destaque Mais Escolhido) -->
            <div class="relative p-space-xl rounded-2xl bg-surface-container shadow-2xl flex flex-col justify-between lg:-translate-y-3 pricing-card pricing-card-featured">
                <!-- Selo Flutuante Sobreposto -->
                <div class="absolute -top-3.5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 px-space-md py-0.5 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-container to-secondary-container shadow-lg">
                    <span class="font-label-capsule text-[11px] font-bold text-on-primary uppercase tracking-wider">PARA AGÊNCIAS</span>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <span class="font-mono-code text-mono-code font-bold text-secondary uppercase mb-1 block">CRESCIMENTO</span>
                    <h3 class="font-headline-card text-headline-card text-on-surface font-bold mb-space-sm">
                Pro
            </h3>
                    <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-space-md">
                Para agências que precisam organizar vários clientes e controlar o investimento.
            </p>
                    <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1 mb-space-lg">
                        <span class="font-label-metric text-label-metric font-bold text-secondary">14 dias grátis</span>
                        <span class="font-body-sm text-outline">sem cartão</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-sm text-body-sm">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-surface">
                            <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary text-[18px]">check</span>8 assentos de usuário
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-surface">
                            <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary text-[18px]">check</span>Até 15 workspaces
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-surface">
                            <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary text-[18px]">check</span>Até R$ 300 mil em mídia
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-surface">
                            <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary text-[18px]">check</span>Meta, Google, Bing e TikTok
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-surface">
                            <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary text-[18px]">check</span>Pacing e proteção de orçamento
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-surface">
                            <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary text-[18px]">check</span>White-label conforme o plano
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-surface">
                            <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary text-[18px]">check</span>Relatórios para sua carteira
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <a class="mt-space-xl w-full py-space-md rounded-xl font-body-md font-semibold text-center text-on-primary bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-container to-secondary-container hover:shadow-[0_0_24px_rgba(0,180,199,0.35)] transition-all" href="/onboarding">Começar teste grátis</a>
            </div>

            <!-- Plano Escala -->
            <div class="p-space-xl rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-low shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-surface-container transition-all pricing-card">
                <div>
                    <span class="font-mono-code text-mono-code font-bold text-tertiary uppercase mb-1 block">ALTO VOLUME</span>
                    <h3 class="font-headline-card text-headline-card text-on-surface font-bold mb-space-sm">
                Enterprise
            </h3>
                    <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-space-md">
                Para operações com múltiplas equipes e necessidades avançadas de gestão.
            </p>
                    <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1 mb-space-lg">
                        <span class="font-label-metric text-label-metric font-bold text-on-surface">14 dias grátis</span>
                        <span class="font-body-sm text-outline">sem cartão</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-sm text-body-sm">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-surface">
                            <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary text-[18px]">check</span>Assentos conforme contratação
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-surface">
                            <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary text-[18px]">check</span>Workspaces conforme contratação
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-surface">
                            <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary text-[18px]">check</span>As quatro redes de anúncios
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-surface">
                            <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary text-[18px]">check</span>Gestão de equipes e carteiras
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-surface">
                            <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary text-[18px]">check</span>Domínio próprio conforme o plano
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-surface">
                            <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary text-[18px]">check</span>Condições confirmadas no checkout
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <a class="mt-space-xl w-full py-space-md rounded-xl font-body-md font-semibold text-center text-on-surface bg-surface-container hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-all" href="/onboarding">Começar teste grátis</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Estrutura Personalizada -->
        <div class="w-full max-w-[800px] p-space-lg rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-space-md text-center sm:text-left shadow-sm">
            <div>
                <span class="font-body-md font-semibold text-on-surface block">Sua carteira pede uma estrutura maior?</span>
                <span class="font-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Compare as opções no cadastro e encontre o plano adequado ao volume de clientes e às necessidades da sua equipe.</span>
            </div>
            <a class="px-space-lg py-space-sm rounded-lg font-body-sm font-semibold text-on-surface bg-surface-container-high hover:bg-surface-variant transition-all whitespace-nowrap" href="/onboarding">Explorar opções</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
